WEBVTT

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:31.620
but a passion that was drawing 
me to my goal.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.820
Eventually, that day came,

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.710
when I joined a space agency.

00:01:37.710 --> 00:01:42.380
I got a letter from ISRO
to join them for their Bangalore center.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:47.860
Now just imagine, 
19 years ago,

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:50.550
when distance was not only 
measured in kilometres

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:52.840
but also in days and hours.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.360
It was just 2000 km.

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:58.700
But the journey spanned 
over two and a half days,

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.600
to a new city so far away, 
without a convenient way to travel.